			<h3><a href="https://opennj.net/AA00001549/00001"><img alt="Click here to access all OER developed for Beginning Algebra" src="https://opennj.net/design/aggregations/analyticgeom_calc/uploads/bosler-geom.png" style="height:135px; width:250px" /></a></h3>

